---
slug: /tentang/profil/
copy:
  id:
    title: Profil sekolah
    crumb: Tentang kami
    historyTitle: Sejarah singkat
    history:
      - "[ISI] Kapan dan oleh siapa sekolah ini didirikan, dan mengapa. Contoh yang baik: \"Didirikan tahun 20xx oleh Yayasan ... karena belum ada SD Islam di kecamatan ini.\""
      - "[ISI] Bagaimana sekolah berkembang sampai sekarang: jumlah kelas, gedung, perubahan penting."
    factsTitle: Data sekolah
    factsHead: [Data, Keterangan]
    facts:
      - ["Nama resmi", "[ISI]"]
      - ["Yayasan", "[ISI]"]
      - ["Tahun berdiri", "[ISI]"]
      - ["Jumlah siswa", "[ISI] siswa, [ISI] rombongan belajar"]
      - ["Akreditasi", "[ISI] (lihat halaman Akreditasi dan izin)"]
      - ["Alamat", "[ISI]"]
    visionTitle: Visi
    vision: "[ISI] Visi resmi sekolah, ditulis apa adanya."
    missionTitle: Misi
    missions: ["[ISI] Misi pertama.", "[ISI] Misi kedua.", "[ISI] Misi ketiga."]
  en:
    title: School profile
    crumb: About
    historyTitle: A short history
    history:
      - "[FILL] When and by whom the school was founded, and why. A good example: \"Founded in 20xx by the ... Foundation because the district had no Islamic primary school.\""
      - "[FILL] How the school has grown since: number of classes, buildings, key changes."
    factsTitle: School data
    factsHead: [Item, Details]
    facts:
      - ["Official name", "[FILL]"]
      - ["Foundation", "[FILL]"]
      - ["Year founded", "[FILL]"]
      - ["Students", "[FILL] students in [FILL] classes"]
      - ["Accreditation", "[FILL] (see Accreditation and licences)"]
      - ["Address", "[FILL]"]
    visionTitle: Vision
    vision: "[FILL] The school's official vision statement, word for word."
    missionTitle: Mission
    missions: ["[FILL] First mission.", "[FILL] Second mission.", "[FILL] Third mission."]
---
{% import "components.njk" as ui %}
{{ ui.pageBanner(c.crumb, c.title, t.photo[lang] + ": gedung sekolah", t.home[lang], '/' | langUrl(lang)) }}

{% call ui.split(c.historyTitle, t.photo[lang] + ": foto lama sekolah, jika ada") %}
  {% for p in c.history %}<p>{{ p }}</p>{% endfor %}
{% endcall %}

<section class="section section--mint">
  <div class="container split" style="align-items:start">
    <div>
      <h2>{{ c.factsTitle }}</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="info-table">
          <thead><tr>{% for h in c.factsHead %}<th>{{ h }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead>
          <tbody>{% for r in c.facts %}<tr><td><strong>{{ r[0] }}</strong></td><td>{{ r[1] }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>{{ c.visionTitle }}</h2>
      <p class="lead">{{ c.vision }}</p>
      <h2 style="margin-top:32px">{{ c.missionTitle }}</h2>
      <ol class="prose">{% for m in c.missions %}<li>{{ m }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/prevnext.njk" %}
